04Z"},"body":"Opening this as a draft pull request until I figure out the following:\r\n\r\n- [x] Where to add validation for the transaction_mode values?\r\n\r\nRight now it's in `get_connection_params`, but it doesn't feel like the right place. We do validation for `NAME` there though, so maybe it's ok? \r\n\r\n- [x] Is `OPTIONS` the right place for this `transaction_mode`?\r\n\r\nJust double checking, since it doesn't feel clean that I have to pop it from the `OPTIONS` dict to avoid `TypeError: 'transaction_mode' is an invalid keyword argument for Connection()`\r\n\r\n- [x] Figure out which documentation files to update\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17760/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17760/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17594","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17594/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17594/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17594/events","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/17594","id":2035372992,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAD-Lgs5hqnGM","number":17594,"title":"Refs #33497 -- Added connection pool support for PostgreSQL.","user":{"login":"sarahboyce","id":42296566,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjk2NTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42296566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarahboyce","html_url":"https://github.com/sarahboyce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarahboyce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarahboyce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarahboyce/gists{/gist_id}","